# The delivered sample archive, as the laboratory handed it over: original
# filenames, original formats, English class folders. It is source material,
# not a pipeline input — ingestion reads it by path and writes a dataset
# version. Never scanned as raw_dir.
ml/data/archive/

# Dataset versions: nothing under one is versioned, the manifest included.
# Reversed on 2026-09-01 by the Developer, against the earlier rule that made
# manifest.csv the versioned record. A dataset version is now reproducible from
# the archive by `python scripts/ingest_archive.py`, which is deterministic, so
# the manifest is a build product rather than a record — and the tests that
# asserted the archive's inventory from the committed manifest now skip wherever
# the version is absent, CI included. See docs/adr/0019.
ml/data/datasets/**
ml/models/**/
ml/notebooks/.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ML generated assets (output of training pipeline)
assets/models/*.tflite
assets/models/spec.json

# Flutter-generated plugin registrants (regenerated by `flutter pub get` / build)
**/flutter/generated_plugin_registrant.cc
**/flutter/generated_plugin_registrant.h
**/flutter/generated_plugins.cmake
**/Flutter/GeneratedPluginRegistrant.swift
# Local design-system reference export (not versioned)
/VisioSoil Design System/
